ed to any variable here.\n","df.fillna(method=\"bfill\")\n","\n","# Interpolate missing values.\n","# This estimates NaN values based on surrounding data points.\n","# This operation returns a new DataFrame, but it's not assigned to any variable here.\n","df.interpolate()\n","\n","# Create a new DataFrame 'df_dropped' by dropping all rows that contain at least one NaN value.\n","df_dropped = df.dropna()\n","# Display the 'df_dropped' DataFrame (implicitly by being the last line in the cell).\n","df_dropped"]}]}